        "original_id": "4b9b0775-3e4d-5ff9-ab31-afd8c0d10409",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: A Perfect Murder; Dial M for Murder; 3 A.M.; Gloria\n- People: Andrew Davis; Michael Douglas; Gwyneth Paltrow; Viggo Mortensen; Alfred Hitchcock; Ray Milland; Grace Kelly; Robert Cummings; John Williams; Sarita Choudhury; John Cassavetes\n\nFacts:\n- Dial M for Murder is a 1954 American crime mystery film directed by Alfred Hitchcock and starring Ray Milland, Grace Kelly, Robert Cummings, and John Williams.\n- A Perfect Murder is a 1998 American crime thriller film directed by Andrew Davis and starring Michael Douglas, Gwyneth Paltrow, and Viggo Mortensen.\n- In the late 1990s, Sarita Choudhury had supporting roles in A Perfect Murder, 3 A.M., and Gloria.\n- Gloria is identified here as a John Cassavetes retread.",
